{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 90, :comments ["<b>לדור</b> — There is a deep sod, for he mentioned above that His word and they, the dwellers of the heavens, stand forever, and the dwellers of the earth, the universals, stand; therefore: לדור ודור." "<b>The reason for ותעמד</b> — the point of the earth is the point of the upper sphere, with complete proofs."], :book :psalms, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 119, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Psalms -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/tehilim"] ["Wikisource Mikraot Gedolot" "http://en.wikisource.org/wiki/Mikraot_Gedolot/"] ["Tanakh, Venice, 1617-1619" "https://dlib.rsl.ru/viewer/01007514045#?page=4"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:40:37.523882551Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}